        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\frac{29}{5}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}6x-(x-4)&=33\\\\6x-x+4&=33\\\\5x+4&=33\\\\5x&=29\\\\x&=\\frac{29}{5}\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
